| `tests/integration/test_check_twins_gate.py` | Requires every structure check to have one id, enforcement sentence and existing fault-injection twin in `scripts/checks_data.py`; rejects stale rows and zero rows judged. Each twin must fail when its check is silent. Practice check references resolve against these registry ids as `check:CHECK-<LETTER>`; bare letters are refused with the replacement spelling. | `make test` | — | Static resolution parses module-level pytest functions without executing twins; the dependence test runs twins in-process with their named checks replaced by no-ops. Check helpers and project-owned checks are outside this registry. | [Conventions](../../CONVENTIONS.md) | always |
